managed_building(V) & monthly_rent(V, R) => deposit_at_least(V, R). @ "The security deposit can be either equal to the monthly rent at a managed building or more"
managed_building(olive_garden). @ "The Olive Garden is a managed building"
monthly_rent(olive_garden, 2000). @ "The monthly rent at the Olive Garden is $2000"
? deposit_at_least(olive_garden, 2000).
